window.DOCS_INDEX=[{"title": "Подключение", "text": " Не вставляйте исходники библиотеки в свой скрипт. Загрузите библиотеку один раз, а затем создавайте интерфейс методами WindUI , Window , вкладок и элементов. ", "url": "index.html#_1"}, {"title": "Одна строка подключения", "text": " Для публичного репозитория: local WindUI = loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/123ads213/WindUI-Remake-2/main/dist/main.lua'))() dist/main.lua возвращает библиотеку. Он не запускает демонстрационное меню , не включает Anti-AFK и не создаёт ваши элементы автоматически. Если репозиторий приватный, анонимный raw URL не работает. Не вставляйте GitHub-токен в Roblox-код. Скачайте dist/main.lua под своей учётной записью, сохраните как WindUI.lua в рабочую папку своего runner и подключите так: local WindUI = loadstring(readfile('WindUI.lua'))() game:HttpGet , loadstring и файловые функции зависят от среды исполнения. Этот способ предназначен для совместимого клиентского runner; обычный LocalScript в Studio не предоставляет эти executor API. ", "url": "index.html#_2"}, {"title": "Первое окно", "text": " local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({ Title = 'My menu', Author = 'My project', Icon = 'settings', Theme = 'Dark', Folder = 'MyProject', NewElements = true, DescriptionMode = 'Tooltip', SearchInTopbar = true, ToggleKey = Enum.KeyCode.RightShift, Size = UDim2.fromOffset(1000, 650), }) local Main = Window:Tab({Title = 'Main', Icon = 'house'}) local columns = Main:Columns() local group = columns.Left:Section({Title = 'Features'}) local enabled = group:Toggle({Title = 'Enabled', Flag = 'enabled', Value = false, Callback = function(value) print('Your feature:', value) end, }) NewElements=true включает новую геометрию. Columns() создаёт две адаптивные колонки; columns.Left:Section() и columns.Right:Section() — карточки. Не путайте их с Tab:Section() , который создаёт обычный заголовок. ", "url": "index.html#_3"}, {"title": "Готовый короткий пример", "text": " QuickStart.lua показывает подключение, окно, две колонки, toggle, настройки через три точки, inline dropdown, slider, тему, профиль и конфиги. Скопируйте этот пример и замените callbacks своими функциями. RemakeExample.lua — более крупное демонстрационное меню. Для автономного запуска демо скачайте dist/remake2.lua ; не подключайте этот файл вместо библиотеки в своём проекте. ", "url": "index.html#_4"}, {"title": "Сохранение", "text": " Каждому сохраняемому элементу задайте уникальный Flag . Создайте все элементы до включения менеджера конфигов: local presets, err = Window:EnablePresets({Default = 'Default'}) if not presets then warn(err) end Клик по названию конфига или стрелке загрузки загружает его один раз . Quick save в шапке сохраняет текущий конфиг. Фильтр сортирует, а повторный клик по активному критерию меняет направление. Подписи со счётчиком внизу нет. ", "url": "index.html#_5"}, {"title": "Версии", "text": " URL с /main/ получает последнюю опубликованную сборку. Для воспроизводимого проекта замените main на полный SHA проверенного коммита. Не используйте случайный latest из другого репозитория. ", "url": "index.html#_6"}, {"title": "Сборка из исходников", "text": " git submodule update --init --recursive npm install npm run build python build/build-remake2.py python -m pip install -r build/requirements-docs.txt python build/build-docs.py Сборка библиотеки требует Luau/darklua по aftman.toml . Сайт документации собирается в docs/site ; его можно открыть локально. GitHub Pages использует workflow .github/workflows/docs.yml ; публикация Pages требует разрешённых Pages в настройках репозитория. Alphabetical ставит названия с буквами перед чисто числовыми: Default → Last → 231 . Повторный выбор меняет направление внутри групп: Last → Default → 231 . Числовые имена сортируются по числу. Сортировка по датам по-прежнему использует реальные created/modified timestamps. ", "url": "index.html#_7"}, {"title": "WindUI Remake 2 — API and integration guide", "text": " Version: 1.7.0-remake.3 . Original WindUI by Footagesus, MIT. This is a UI library: example settings do not implement ESP, targeting or gameplay logic. ", "url": "api.html#windui-remake-2-api-and-integration-guide"}, {"title": "Start here (including AI coding assistants)", "text": " Work in WindUI-Remake-2 , not the frozen first-remake repo. Read this file and RemakeExample.lua . Use the exact APIs below; do not invent LeftColumn , AddGroupbox , SetDependency or cloud endpoints. Keep the native WindUI font, registered themes, color editor, hotkeys and HUD. Do not replace the title font or globally redesign legacy controls. Give every persisted control a unique stable Flag across all tabs, columns and subtabs. Labels are not identifiers. The new two-column UI is opt-in. Existing Window:Tab , sidebar Tab:SubTab / Tab:Tab , and original element APIs still work. Create controls first, then call Window:EnablePresets so the first save contains all flags. Late controls are registered too, but explicitly load again when their persisted state is needed. ", "url": "api.html#start-here-including-ai-coding-assistants"}, {"title": "Build and launch", "text": " git submodule update --init --recursive npm run build python build/build-remake2.py Use Luau/darklua installed on PATH. The built dist/remake2.lua embeds both library and the full original menu, adapted rather than replaced . Search, Visuals → Player/World, General, Themes, profile/preferences/history, both color examples, HUD and original numeric examples remain available. For library-only loading, see installation and QuickStart.lua . Public raw URLs work only while the repository is public; for private access download the file first and use loadstring(readfile('WindUI.lua'))() . Never embed a PAT in a Roblox script . dist/main.lua is the library only. ForkExample.lua / RestoreBaseline.lua remain historical baseline files. ", "url": "api.html#build-and-launch"}, {"title": "Window, tabs and columns", "text": " local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({ Title = 'Sirius', Author = 'Ui library', Icon = 'star', HideSearchBar = false, SearchInTopbar = true, ToggleKey = Enum.KeyCode.RightShift, Folder = 'MyUI', Theme = 'Dark', NewElements = true, Size = UDim2.fromOffset(1100, 720), MinSize = Vector2.new(700, 420), MaxSize = Vector2.new(1200, 800), DescriptionMode = 'Tooltip', ContentPaddingTop = 8, }) local Visuals = Window:Tab({Title = 'Visuals', Icon = 'image'}) local columns = Visuals:Columns({Gap = 16, MinColumnWidth = 260}) local main = columns.Left:Section({Title = 'Main'}) local other = columns.Right:Section({Title = 'Other'}) -- :Group({...}) on a COLUMN is an alias for :Section({...}). Each column stacks independent section cards; rows within a card are 50 logical pixels high. Section titles sit above the rounded card. Controls sit on one horizontal row: title on the left, control on the right. Widths adapt equally; below 2 * MinColumnWidth + Gap , the complete left column stacks above the right one. The tab scrolls vertically. Reading order and values are preserved. Columns returns .Left , .Right , and .UIElements ( Root , Left , Right ). Use Section on a column to create a card. Legacy Tab:Section still means the original section element. Keep a reasonable minimum column width for long labels; labels truncate, not overlap. Customize control Width when necessary. ", "url": "api.html#window-tabs-and-columns"}, {"title": "Header search and profile actions", "text": " SearchInTopbar = true places the existing working search in the top-right button group, before minimize/fullscreen/close; it removes the old sidebar search gap. Keep HideSearchBar = false to enable search. Omit SearchInTopbar for legacy sidebar search. Window:CreateProfile(...) now includes Menu bind above Unload . Click Menu bind and press a keyboard key; Escape cancels, Backspace/Delete clears it. Capturing does not also toggle the window. The example defaults to RightShift. Window:SetToggleKey(Enum.KeyCode.F8) changes it programmatically; nil unbinds. This window preference is session-local, not an element flag. Unload invokes the existing Window:Destroy() lifecycle and removes the library GUIs and connections. Do not replace it with a visual-only hide. Preset Create/Rename forms are 306×148 logical pixels; JSON forms expand only when required. Actions and metadata rows use native themed icons. A click on the config trigger immediately dismisses its hover information before opening the preset list; editors replace rather than stack with the list. ", "url": "api.html#header-search-and-profile-actions"}, {"title": "Horizontal icon subtabs (not sidebar children)", "text": " local pages = Visuals:IconTabs() local enemies = pages:Tab({Id = 'enemies', Title = 'Enemies', Icon = 'user'}) local teammates = pages:Tab({Id = 'team', Title = 'Teammates', Icon = 'user-minus'}) local enemyColumns = enemies:Columns({MinColumnWidth = 260}) local teamColumns = teammates:Columns({MinColumnWidth = 260}) enemyColumns.Left:Section({Title = 'Enemy'}):Toggle({ Title = 'Show players', Value = true, Flag = 'enemy.enabled', }) teamColumns.Left:Section({Title = 'Team'}):Toggle({ Title = 'Show teammates', Value = false, Flag = 'team.enabled', }) pages:Select('team') -- ID, or 1-based page index; returns false for an unknown page. enemies:Select() The active top-right button shows icon + title; other buttons are compact icons. Pages are created once and keep independent values. Switching fades in the chosen page. No game model preview is fabricated; a real Viewport can be added separately. The previously supported sidebar nesting remains separate. ", "url": "api.html#horizontal-icon-subtabs-not-sidebar-children"}, {"title": "Compact elements and examples", "text": " The following inherit compact row layout inside columns/cards. Their original APIs still apply. local enabled = main:Toggle({ Title = 'Enabled', Value = true, Flag = 'main.enabled', Desc = 'Enable dependent settings.', Hotkeys = {{Key = 'K', Mode = 'Toggle', Value = true}}, Callback = function(value) print(value) end, }) local distance = main:Slider({ Title = 'Distance', Width = 140, ValueWidth = 44, Value = {Min = 0, Max = 1000, Default = 500}, Step = 1, Flag = 'main.distance', Callback = function(value) print(value) end, }) local label = main:Input({Title = 'Label', Value = 'Sirius', Flag = 'main.label'}) main:Button({Title = 'Reset distance', Callback = function() distance:Set(500) end}) local color = other:Colorpicker({ Title = 'Accent', Default = Color3.fromHex('2a94ff'), Transparency = .15, Flag = 'main.color', Callback = function(color, transparency, gradient) end, }) Toggle: :Set(boolean) , .Value , :Lock() , :Unlock() . Right-click retains the native multiple-hotkey manager and animated New Hotkey rows. Hotkeys=false disables binding support. Slider: :Set(number) , :Get() , :SetRange(min,max) , :SetMin , :SetMax , .Value.Default . Transparency-style 4px track with no large thumb. A compact rounded value editor sits to its right. Click it to type an exact number; input is snapped to Step and clamped to Min/Max. The floating value appears only while dragging, never on simple hover. Compact total width defaults to184 with a72px value slot; Width and ValueWidth remain configurable. .UIElements.ValueInput and .UIElements.SliderContainer.TextBox both reference the inline editor; .UIElements.HoverValue is the drag-only label. Input: :Set(text) , .Value , editable right-hand text box. Button: invokes Callback ; use for actions, not saved state. Colorpicker: :Set(color,transparency) , :SetGradient , :Export , :Import , :Open . Existing HEX/RGB/HSV/HSL, alpha, gradients and swatch context-copy/paste are preserved. Common: Title , Desc , Flag , Locked , Callback , :SetTitle , :Destroy where supported. Paragraph, Section, Divider, Space, Image, Code, Group, HStack, VStack and Viewport remain the native WindUI elements , not forced into a 50px compact row. Use their original APIs documented in the repository and FORK.md ; do not assume they are compact controls. Cards support them through the same element factory. ", "url": "api.html#compact-elements-and-examples"}, {"title": "Dropdown / multi-select", "text": " local target = main:Dropdown({ Title = 'Target', Values = {'Closest', 'Distance', 'Health'}, Value = 'Closest', Width = 140, MenuWidth = 190, Flag = 'main.target', Callback = function(value) print(value) end, }) local details = main:Dropdown({ Title = 'Details', Values = {'Name', 'Distance', 'Health', 'Team'}, Multi = true, AllowNone = true, Value = {'Name', 'Health'}, SearchBarEnabled = true, Flag = 'main.details', Callback = function(values) end, }) target:Select('Health') details:Select({'Name', 'Distance'}) target:Refresh({'Closest', 'Distance', 'Health', 'Team'}) target:Open(); target:Close() Trigger stays beside its label. The nearby popup follows the trigger, respects UI scale and screen edges, flips above if needed, and has a soft shadow. Selection is marked by a right-hand check icon. Multi-select stays open; AllowNone=false prevents clearing the last selected option by mouse. Long preview text truncates. All options remain visible/searchable in the popup. Outside click, Escape, hidden dependency or hidden tab closes it. Only one compact dropdown is open per window. .Values , .Value , .Opened , .Tabs , :Display , :Refresh , :Select , :Open , :Close , :Lock , :Unlock are available. String values are recommended. {Title='Name', Locked=true} choices are supported; compact mode does not render rich descriptions or divider rows. Use original dropdown outside compact containers for those legacy menus. ", "url": "api.html#dropdown-multi-select"}, {"title": "Animated visibility and dependencies", "text": " local builder = main:Toggle({Title='Builder', Value=false, Flag='builder.enabled'}) local settings = columns.Right:Section({ Title = 'Builder settings', VisibleWhen = function() return builder.Value end, }) local amount = settings:Slider({ Title='Amount', Value={Min=0,Max=100,Default=35}, Flag='builder.amount', }) local extra = main:Slider({ Title='Extra', Value={Min=0,Max=10,Default=3}, Flag='builder.extra', VisibleWhen=function() return builder.Value and target.Value=='Health' end, }) extra:SetVisible(false) -- explicit master gate extra:SetVisible(true) -- predicate is still respected extra:VisibleWhen(builder) -- shorthand: builder.Value == true extra:VisibleWhen(target, 'Health') extra:SetVisible(false, true) -- instant transition request VisibleWhen must be a pure, non-yielding function ; do not create controls, write files, or change values inside it. Errors hide the dependent slot. Opacity and layout height ease together, including reversal midway. Hidden elements retain values and remain registered for config save/load. Hidden slots stop interaction and hidden dependency hotkeys are unavailable. Once revealed, interaction resumes. Dependency checks run on Heartbeat, so direct setters, hotkeys and config loads are all observed without overwriting user callbacks. Cards and compact controls expose :SetVisible and :VisibleWhen . To opt a legacy element into this wrapper, pass Visible=true or VisibleWhen=... at creation. ", "url": "api.html#animated-visibility-and-dependencies"}, {"title": "Built-in local presets", "text": " -- Call after creating the flagged controls. Requires executor file support. local presets, err = Window:EnablePresets({Default='Default', Author='Your name'}) assert(presets, err) local ok, err = presets:Create('My settings') -- saves current values, refuses overwrite assert(ok, err) presets:Save() -- selected preset presets:Load('My settings') presets:Rename('My settings', 'Renamed settings') local json, err = presets:Export('Renamed settings') presets:Import('Imported settings', json) -- validates; refuses overwrite presets:Delete('Imported settings') presets:Refresh() presets:Toggle() ", "url": "api.html#built-in-local-presets"}, {"title": "UI", "text": " The original top window header, immediately right of the sidebar title block, contains a save icon and active preset name/chevron. It is not an extra row below the header. Hovering the name shows name, author and modified date. Clicking opens a rounded local Presets panel with the reference icon order (cloud/Presets on the left; upload, folder-clock/Recent and plus on the right), search and sorting below, new preset, load/save and per-row Rename/Export/Delete actions. Delete requires confirmation. Errors are shown; Export also copies when setclipboard exists, otherwise the selectable JSON box is available. Import uses a real JSON text box, not an invented external clipboard reader. ", "url": "api.html#ui"}, {"title": "Storage and guarantees", "text": " Path: WindUI/<Window.Folder>/config/<name>.json . Needs writefile , readfile , isfile , isfolder , makefolder ; enumeration uses listfiles , deletion/rename needs delfile . Not available in ordinary Roblox LocalScripts/Studio. EnablePresets returns nil,error when storage is unavailable. JSON contains __version , __elements (flagged control values and hotkeys), __custom , __autoload , __meta (author/created/modified) and __hud if a HUD exists. Theme can be persisted using a flagged theme dropdown whose callback calls WindUI:SetTheme . Unflagged values are not magically serialized. Window size, selected icon page and every arbitrary callback side effect are not presets. Names are trimmed, limited to64 UTF-8 bytes and reject path separators, control characters and reserved filename characters. Import rejects malformed JSON and invalid basic element records. Known element types are checked before application; load is synchronous for values, parser failure rolls values back. User callbacks may run asynchronously and their external side effects cannot be rolled back. Unknown flags are ignored, enabling configs to survive removed controls. Do not reuse the same flag for a different type. presets.Current is the selected name; presets.Sort accepts 'Created' , 'Modified' or 'Name' ; call :Refresh() after changing it. The cloud icon is visual reference styling only; folder-clock shows recently modified local presets, not version backups. This is local persistence , not cloud storage or multi-device sync. File operations are not crash-atomic. ", "url": "api.html#storage-and-guarantees"}, {"title": "HUD retained from remake 1", "text": " local hud=Window:CreateHUD({Watermark=true,Keylist=true,Builds={YourRobloxName='Nightly'}}) hud:SetFields({'FPS','Ping','Username','Time','Day','Avatar','Platform','Build'}) hud:SetWatermarkEnabled(true) hud:SetKeylistEnabled(true) hud:ResetPositions() Watermark telemetry, Sirius brand, full weekday, theme-aware opaque surfaces, white drag guides, Classic keylist, smaller binding plates, multiple hotkeys and config persistence remain available. The new example includes HUD controls in General. ", "url": "api.html#hud-retained-from-remake-1"}, {"title": "Verification", "text": " npm test : inherited model tests + ConfigNames validation tests. Compile new modules with luau-compile ; build with darklua. Execute tests/Remake2.lua in the game after the demo: actual file create/save/load/rename/delete/import/export, flag registry, dependencies, dropdown selection, subtabs, responsive columns. Temporary __qa_* files are deleted and the selected preset is restored. Inspect real game screenshots in Light and Dark, open dropdown/presets, reveal dependencies and resize. Unit tests are not a substitute for visual inspection. ", "url": "api.html#verification"}, {"title": "Thin numeric controls", "text": " Sliders use thin tracks without oversized thumbs, plus a right-side rounded inline value editor. Floating values appear only during dragging and use a weak12% dark shadow. Numeric parsing, min/max, steps, callbacks, locks and config persistence are unchanged. IsTextbox=false hides the inline editor; drag feedback remains available. Inline editors use stable display width and clipped text; on focus the field expands smoothly within its control, with the track shrinking by the same amount, so typing never spills outside the control. In compact section cards ProgressBar also uses a50px row, single-line title, thin track and read-only hover value. This fixes Balance/Collection mismatched row heights without turning progress indicators into interactive sliders. The outer section card owns the rounded background; compact rows do not draw separate rounded plates, including after theme changes. Section cards hide the separator after the last visible row automatically. This also follows animated SetVisible / VisibleWhen changes; do not draw your own bottom separator on the final row. Icon subtabs share one rounded background group. The active button has a neutral theme-matched surface and brighter icon; the inactive button remains neutral. Selection/hover transitions do not erase the selected state. IconTabs().UIElements.Group exposes the shared plate. ", "url": "api.html#thin-numeric-controls"}, {"title": "Per-feature settings popovers", "text": " Any native element exposes :Settings(options) . On a toggle this adds the ellipsis left of the switch ; clicking it does not toggle the feature. The popover uses an8px gap beside its button, flips/clamps at the viewport edge, has the feature title above independent rounded cards, and grows with content until scrolling is necessary. Escape, outside click or its close button closes it. Opening another feature closes the previous one. local enabled = main:Toggle({Title = 'Overlay', Flag = 'overlay', Value = true}) local options = enabled:Settings({Title = 'Overlay', Width = 380}) local features = options:Section() -- untitled rounded card features:Toggle({Title = 'Names', Flag = 'overlay_names', Value = true}) features:Toggle({Title = 'Health', Flag = 'overlay_health', Value = true}) features:Dropdown({Title = 'Style', Inline = true, Flag = 'overlay_style', Values = {'Classic', 'Minimal'}, Value = 'Classic'}) local display = options:Section({Title = 'Display'}) -- another card local opacity = display:Slider({ Title = 'Opacity', Flag = 'overlay_opacity', Value = {Min = 0, Max = 100, Default = 85}, Step = 1, }) display:Dropdown({Title = 'Target', Flag = 'overlay_target', Values = {'Classic', 'Minimal'}, Value = 'Classic'}) options:Open() options:Close() :Group aliases :Section . A section supports the same native controls as column cards, including sliders, toggles, dropdowns, inputs and color pickers. Flags register with the same window preset manager; values survive closing the popover. VisibleWhen / SetVisible still work. These settings are UI examples, not implementations of gameplay features. Alternatively supply Settings = function(popover, element) ... end in an element config, with optional SettingsConfig = {Title = '...', Width = 380} . The builder receives the same controller. Introspection: .Opened , .Sections , .UIElements.Panel/Button/Title/Body/Columns . ", "url": "api.html#per-feature-settings-popovers"}, {"title": "Slider interaction and appearance follow-up", "text": " -50px compact rows,15px row labels and slightly larger example window1100×720 improve readability without changing the font family or sidebar typography. - Inline value editors use the theme's neutral Button surface rather than a hard black plate. Default minimum value width72px prevents compact values such as 413.46m from clipping. Focus expands the field smoothly, with the track shrinking by the same amount; blur restores its width. Min/Max/Step validation remains in the shared numeric model. - Floating drag values fade/scale in and out with a weak shadow. Ordinary hover never opens them. - Hover the slider control and press Left/Right to change by Step. Holding repeats after320ms, then every60ms. Bounds, locks, hidden controls, a closed window, Roblox's menu and active text editing are respected. No floating drag number opens for arrow input. ", "url": "api.html#slider-interaction-and-appearance-follow-up"}, {"title": "Preset buttons and ordering follow-up", "text": " Toolbar icon buttons have delayed hover labels beside the button with an8px gap. Save is separate from the preset-name dropdown: presets:QuickSave() saves the selected preset, verifies its file and shows a named success/failure notification. presets.UIElements.Save is the actual quick-save button. The Sort button opens a checked menu with Newest First ( Created ), Recently Modified ( Modified ) and Alphabetical ( Name ). presets.Sort accepts these keys; :Refresh() reapplies it. Introspection: .SortOptions and .UIElements.SortMenu/Tooltips . Sorting is local; it is not a cloud preset browser or an automatic-save service. ", "url": "api.html#preset-buttons-and-ordering-follow-up"}, {"title": "Outlined groups and embedded selection", "text": " Feature popover groups default to a thin, low-contrast rounded outline with a quiet fill, matching the reference grouping rather than separate floating panels. options:Section({Outlined=false}) restores the filled card. Ordinary column sections can opt in with Outlined=true ; .UIElements.Card exposes the group surface. Only the groups have this outline: floating popup chrome still uses its soft shadow. group:Dropdown({Inline=true, Values={'Classic','Minimal'}, Value='Classic', Flag='style'}) renders all choices directly inside the group with a checkmark on the left and an animated selected surface. No extra popup or trigger is created. ShowTitle=true optionally displays the element title. It supports Multi , AllowNone , locked values, :Select() , :Refresh() and standard flag persistence. Without Inline=true , dropdowns retain the nearby floating checked menu. Embedded choices remain within the settings panel and contribute to its height/scrolling. The reference-style example puts six inline choices in the first outlined group, then Subtick mode and Turn speed in a second group. The Selections gallery demonstrates Classic/Minimal as a normal floating choice; embedded selection is restricted to feature settings opened through the ellipsis. Sort entries now include calendar, clock and alphabetical-order icons alongside the active checkmark. The preset toolbar was shifted seven logical pixels left. ", "url": "api.html#outlined-groups-and-embedded-selection"}, {"title": "Gallery example and animation details", "text": " RemakeExample.lua now contains the registered demo elements. In addition to Player/World/General/Themes, Elements expands to Controls, Selections and Containers. Controls has Interactive/States icon subtabs; Selections covers single/multi/searchable choices and colors/gradients; Containers demonstrates Group/HStack/VStack/Section/Divider/Space. HUD preview provides watermark/keylist/field/position controls. Example callbacks are UI-only, not gameplay implementations. WindUIForkDemo.Showcase exposes the gallery controls. Compact dropdown previews follow configured Values order, regardless of click order. Long previews are clipped with an alpha fade at the right edge, never an ellipsis. Changing the selection fades out the old preview and fades in the new one. Preset refresh reuses named row instances and tweens their positions over240ms when sorting. New/removed or filtered rows fade in/out rather than rebuilding the entire list. presets.Order and presets.RowCache expose the current order and reusable rows for tests. Drag numbers on sliders inside a feature popover clamp to that popover, not the main window. This prevents the number from jumping sideways when the panel extends outside the menu. Outlined cards leave a one-pixel inset around their stroke so CanvasGroup clipping cannot remove the straight border edges. Example-only Anti-AFK is enabled by default under General. It listens for LocalPlayer.Idled and attempts a VirtualUser idle pulse. Unsupported APIs are reported; network disconnects and server kicks are not prevented. Its connection is disconnected on unload/rerun. It is not automatically installed by the library itself. ", "url": "api.html#gallery-example-and-animation-details"}, {"title": "Screenshot review fixes", "text": " Click a preset row once , or its download icon, to load it. Both show a named success/failure notification. The download icon always reloads, even for the current preset; only the header save button saves. Only the current preset has a persistent row highlight. Newest First sorts descending by creation time, Recently Modified descending by modification time, and Alphabetical by name. Identical relative ordering across criteria is valid; existing rows animate to their sorted positions. There is no sort/count footer. Re-selecting the active criterion reverses its direction; :SetSort(key,reversed) selects a direction explicitly. Section cards and Group/HStack/VStack clip child surfaces through rounded CanvasGroups. Compact lock overlays fit their row instead of extending beyond it. Inline=true is supported only in feature :Settings() groups; normal-page use raises a descriptive error. The obsolete Nested tabs explanation plate was removed from General. All Hotkeys uses the library's custom draggable scrollbar, hidden when the content fits. Long hover descriptions show an ellipsis. Hover or click it to widen/expand the panel and read the full untruncated text; oversized descriptions can scroll. Moving from the feature row into its description no longer dismisses it immediately. ", "url": "api.html#screenshot-review-fixes"}, {"title": "Compact UI revision", "text": " Feature settings default to336px width,38px control rows and smaller section gaps. Width remains configurable. Group/HStack/VStack draw symmetric12px container corners; joined child plates use square joins instead of the old horizontal half-squircle assets. The profile theme value is adjacent to its chevron. Menu bind and Quick save retain their original, unaccented styling at the user’s request. Both remain clickable; the theme value is still closer to its chevron. Hover description hit-testing uses the same inset-adjusted coordinates as the UI. Expansion preserves the control beneath the pointer, never reduces panel height, and leaves a minus control for collapse. The expanded panel stays open while the cursor is over its text, closes after leaving, and scrolls for oversized content. The demo no longer contains Media & code or the Try the HUD/Native containers explanation plates. The library still includes Code, Image and Viewport APIs for projects that need them. ", "url": "api.html#compact-ui-revision"}, {"title": "Config load performance and cleanup", "text": " New text registers its font once; registration does not restyle all existing labels. Destroyed text/theme objects are removed from the font/theme registries. Reapplying the same theme is a no-op. Preset row icons are reused instead of destroyed/recreated on every refresh. All Hotkeys renders lazily while visible, coalesces updates, and defers rendering until a config batch completes. Loading a preset does not rebuild a hidden hotkey list. Config loading preflights types, skips unchanged serialized values, applies changed values in a batch with a3ms cooperative frame budget, and rolls back on a parser failure. Hotkey enforcement is suspended during the batch and restored afterward. Concurrent preset loads are rejected as busy rather than stacked. Public presets:Load(name) still returns only after applying values; it may yield to Heartbeat to keep rendering responsive. Arbitrary user callbacks can still be expensive: keep them small or schedule your own expensive work. Unchanged values do not re-fire their callbacks merely because a preset is loaded again. presets.LastLoadStats and Window.LastConfigLoadStats expose Applied , Skipped , Yields , DurationMs . These are diagnostics, not a frame-time guarantee. Alphabetical ставит названия с буквами перед чисто числовыми: Default → Last → 231 . Повторный выбор меняет направление внутри групп: Last → Default → 231 . Числовые имена сортируются по числу. Сортировка по датам по-прежнему использует реальные created/modified timestamps. ", "url": "api.html#config-load-performance-and-cleanup"}, {"title": "Composed appearance controls and local model preview", "text": " See theme and composition guide : section:Compound({Title,Color,Dropdown}) , section:Compound({Title,Color,Toggle}) and section:PlayerPreview({Height,Model,State}) . Children use independent native flags and callbacks. Mock preview is local-only and contains no ESP/player scanning. Compact dropdowns and preset toolbar do not add hover fills. ", "url": "api.html#composed-appearance-controls-and-local-model-preview"}, {"title": "Справочник методов", "text": " Точные сигнатуры взяты из текущих исходников. Ссылки «source» ведут к месту определения. Для настроек, поведения и готовых фрагментов используйте API guide и примеры . Таблицы ниже не заменяют описание параметров конфигурации. Методы, привязанные к объекту, вызываются через : , фабричные внутренние New / Init сюда не включены. ", "url": "reference.html#_1"}, {"title": "Создание элементов", "text": " Контейнеры предоставляют :Toggle(config) , :Slider(config) , :ProgressBar(config) , :Dropdown(config) , :Input(config) , :Button(config) , :Colorpicker(config) , :Paragraph(config) , :Section(config) , :Divider(config) , :Space(config) , :Group(config) , :HStack(config) , :VStack(config) , :Code(config) , :Image(config) , :Viewport(config) . Удалён только демонстрационный раздел Media & code, не методы библиотеки. Основные поля: Title , Desc , Flag , Value , Callback , Locked , Visible , VisibleWhen . Dropdown использует Values ; slider и progress — Value={Min,Max,Default} . См. API guide для конкретного типа. Для IconTabs и Columns см. раздел Layout ниже. column:Section() — карточка, Tab:Section() — заголовок. ", "url": "reference.html#_2"}, {"title": "WindUI", "text": " Метод Исходник WindUI.GenerateGUID() source WindUI:SetParent(parent) source WindUI:Notify(Config) source WindUI:SetNotificationLower(Val) source WindUI:SetFont(FontId) source WindUI:OnThemeChange(func) source WindUI:AddTheme(LTheme) source WindUI:SetTheme(Value) source WindUI:GetThemes() source WindUI:GetCurrentTheme() source WindUI:GetTransparency() source WindUI:GetWindowSize() source WindUI:Localization(LocalizationConfig) source WindUI:SetLanguage(Value) source WindUI:ToggleAcrylic(Value) source WindUI:Gradient(stops, props) source WindUI:Popup(PopupConfig) source WindUI:CreateWindow(Config) source ", "url": "reference.html#windui"}, {"title": "Window", "text": " Метод Исходник Window:CreateTopbarButton(Name, Icon, Callback, LayoutOrder, IconThemed, Color, IconSize) source Window:SetLockOffscreen(enabled) source Window:SetPosition(position) source Window:SetDragSmoothness(value) source Window:SetToggleKey(keycode) source Window:SetTitle(text) source Window:SetAuthor(text) source Window:SetSize(size) source Window:SetBackgroundImage(id) source Window:SetBackgroundImageTransparency(v) source Window:SetBackgroundTransparency(value) source Window:ToggleFullscreen() source Window:OnOpen(func) source Window:OnClose(func) source Window:OnDestroy(func) source Window:SetIconSize(Size) source Window:Open() source Window:Close() source Window:Destroy() source Window:Toggle() source Window:ToggleTransparency(value) source Window:LockAll() source Window:UnlockAll() source Window:GetLocked() source Window:GetUnlocked() source Window:GetUIScale(v) source Window:SetUIScale(v) source Window:SetToTheCenter() source Window:SetCurrentConfig(ConfigModule) source Window:EditOpenButton(OpenButtonConfig) source Window:Tab(TabConfig) source Window:SelectTab(Tab) source Window:Section(SectionConfig) source Window:IsResizable(v) source Window:SetPanelBackground(v) source Window:CreateProfile(profileConfig) source Window:Divider() source Window:Dialog(DialogConfig) source Window:Tag(TagConfig) source Window:DisableTopbarButtons(btns) source Window:ShowHotkeys() source Window:CreateHUD(config) source Window:SetCustomCursor(config) source Window:EnablePresets(options) source ", "url": "reference.html#window"}, {"title": "Tab", "text": " Метод Исходник Tab:ScrollToTheElement(elemindex) source Tab:LockAll() source Tab:UnlockAll() source Tab:GetLocked() source Tab:GetUnlocked() source Tab:Expand() source Tab:Collapse() source Tab:SubTab(SubConfig) source Tab:Select() source ", "url": "reference.html#tab"}, {"title": "Layout: columns and icon tabs", "text": " Метод Исходник col:Section(cfg) source tab:Columns(config) source tab:IconTabs(config) source controller:Tab(cfg) source p:Columns(c) source p:Select() source controller:Select(which) source ", "url": "reference.html#layout-columns-and-icon-tabs"}, {"title": "Profile", "text": " Метод Исходник profile:BeginMenuBind() source profile:CancelMenuBind() source profile:SetTransparency(value) source profile:GetTransparency() source profile:SyncTheme() source profile:CloseFlyout() source profile:OpenFlyout(kind) source profile:ShowPage(page) source profile:Open() source profile:Close() source profile:Renew() source profile:SetSubscription(info) source profile:Destroy() source ", "url": "reference.html#profile"}, {"title": "HUD", "text": " Метод Исходник hud:SetWatermarkEnabled(v) source hud:SetKeylistEnabled(v) source hud:SetField(id,v) source hud:SetFields(selection) source hud:GetFields() source hud:GetAvailableFields() source hud:SetKeylistMode(mode) source hud:ResetPositions() source hud:Export() source hud:Import(data) source hud:GetMetrics() source hud:Destroy() source ", "url": "reference.html#hud"}, {"title": "Presets", "text": " Метод Исходник presets:Create(name) source presets:QuickSave() source presets:Save(name) source presets:Load(name) source presets:LoadFromUI(name) source presets:Delete(name) source presets:Export(name) source presets:Import(name,json) source presets:Rename(old,new) source presets:Refresh() source presets:Toggle() source presets:SetSort(key,reversed) source ", "url": "reference.html#presets"}, {"title": "Feature settings", "text": " Метод Исходник options:Section(cfg) source options:Close() source options:Open() source options:Toggle() source options:Destroy() source ", "url": "reference.html#feature-settings"}, {"title": "Common element methods", "text": " Метод Исходник element:SetTitle(title) source element:SetDesc(desc) source element:SetImage(image, size) source element:SetThumbnail(image, size) source element:Highlight() source element:Destroy() source element:Settings(options) source ", "url": "reference.html#common-element-methods"}, {"title": "Visibility", "text": " Метод Исходник element:SetVisible(value,instant) source element:VisibleWhen(control,expected) source ", "url": "reference.html#visibility"}, {"title": "Hotkeys and descriptions", "text": " Метод Исходник element:ShowDescription() source element:GetHotkeys() source element:SetHotkeys(rows) source element:AddHotkey(data) source element:ResetHotkeys() source element:OpenHotkeys(point) source ", "url": "reference.html#hotkeys-and-descriptions"}, {"title": "Compound", "text": " Метод Исходник compound:GetControl(name) source compound:Lock() source compound:Unlock() source ", "url": "reference.html#compound"}, {"title": "PlayerPreview", "text": " Метод Исходник playerPreview:SetModel(model) source playerPreview:Update(values) source playerPreview:SetColor(color) source playerPreview:SetBoxColor(color) source playerPreview:SetMode(mode) source playerPreview:SetEnabled(value) source playerPreview:SetRotation(degrees) source playerPreview:GetState() source ", "url": "reference.html#playerpreview"}, {"title": "Toggle", "text": " Метод Исходник toggle:Lock() source toggle:Unlock() source toggle:Set(v, isCallback, isAnim) source ", "url": "reference.html#toggle"}, {"title": "Slider", "text": " Метод Исходник slider:Set(newValue) source slider:Get() source slider:SetRange(newMin, newMax) source slider:SetMin(newMin) source slider:SetMax(newMax) source slider:Lock() source slider:Unlock() source ", "url": "reference.html#slider"}, {"title": "ProgressBar", "text": " Метод Исходник progressBar:Set(Value) source progressBar:Get() source progressBar:GetPercentage() source progressBar:SetRange(NewMin, NewMax) source progressBar:SetMin(NewMin) source progressBar:SetMax(NewMax) source ", "url": "reference.html#progressbar"}, {"title": "Input", "text": " Метод Исходник input:Lock() source input:Unlock() source input:Set(v, IsUserInput) source input:SetPlaceholder(v) source ", "url": "reference.html#input"}, {"title": "Button", "text": " Метод Исходник button:Lock() source button:Unlock() source ", "url": "reference.html#button"}, {"title": "CompactDropdown", "text": " Метод Исходник compactDropdown:Select(value) source compactDropdown:Refresh(values) source compactDropdown:Open() source compactDropdown:Close() source compactDropdown:Lock() source compactDropdown:Unlock() source ", "url": "reference.html#compactdropdown"}, {"title": "InlineDropdown", "text": " Метод Исходник inlineDropdown:Select(value) source inlineDropdown:Refresh(values) source inlineDropdown:Lock() source inlineDropdown:Unlock() source inlineDropdown:Open() source inlineDropdown:Close() source ", "url": "reference.html#inlinedropdown"}, {"title": "Colorpicker", "text": " Метод Исходник colorpicker:GetValue() source colorpicker:GetGradient() source colorpicker:GetColorSequence() source colorpicker:SetState(value,callback) source colorpicker:SetGradient(value,callback) source colorpicker:Update(color,transparency) source colorpicker:Set(color,transparency) source colorpicker:Reset(callback) source colorpicker:Export() source colorpicker:Import(data) source colorpicker:Lock() source colorpicker:Unlock() source colorpicker:Open() source ", "url": "reference.html#colorpicker"}, {"title": "Code", "text": " Метод Исходник code:SetCode(code) source code:Set(code) source code:Destroy() source code.UpdateShape(Tab) source ", "url": "reference.html#code"}, {"title": "Viewport", "text": " Метод Исходник viewport:SetObject(Object, IsClone) source viewport:SetHeight(Height) source viewport:Focus() source viewport:SetCamera(Camera) source viewport:SetInteractive(Interactive) source ", "url": "reference.html#viewport"}, {"title": "Свойства и стабильные идентификаторы", "text": " element.Value — текущее значение toggle/dropdown/input; slider:Get() — числовое значение slider. Window.PendingFlags и .UIElements предназначены в первую очередь для расширений и диагностики; не привязывайте бизнес-логику к случайным именам GUI descendants. presets.Current , .Sort , .SortReversed доступны для чтения. Используйте :SetSort(key,reversed) , а не прямое изменение поля, чтобы сразу обновить UI. presets:Create/Save/Load/Import/Rename/Delete возвращают ok, err ; Export возвращает JSON или false, err . У Toggle:Set(value, isCallback, isAnim) дополнительные флаги меняют вызов callback и анимацию. Для обычной работы достаточно :Set(value) . :SetVisible() / :VisibleWhen(control,expected) доступны элементам, для которых подключена Visibility: compact rows, элементы с Visible / VisibleWhen и секции-карточки. Они не автоматически присутствуют у любого legacy объекта. ", "url": "reference.html#_3"}, {"title": "Примеры методов", "text": " Все фрагменты ниже предполагают, что библиотека уже загружена и Window создан. Полный минимальный пример — QuickStart.lua . ", "url": "recipes.html#_1"}, {"title": "Вкладки и две колонки", "text": " local Visuals = Window:Tab({Title = 'Visuals', Icon = 'image'}) local Player = Visuals:SubTab({Title = 'Player', Icon = 'user'}) local columns = Player:Columns({Gap = 16, MinColumnWidth = 260}) local left = columns.Left:Section({Title = 'Main'}) local right = columns.Right:Section({Title = 'Appearance'}) Для горизонтальных вкладок внутри страницы используйте Player:IconTabs() , затем pages:Tab({Title='Enemy', Id='enemy', Icon='user'}) и pages:Select('enemy') . Это не те же sidebar SubTab. ", "url": "recipes.html#_2"}, {"title": "Toggle, slider и callback", "text": " local enabled = left:Toggle({Title = 'Enabled', Flag = 'enabled', Value = true, Callback = function(value) print(value) end}) local speed = left:Slider({Title = 'Speed', Flag = 'speed', Step = .1, Value = {Min = 0, Max = 100, Default = 50}, Callback = function(value) print(value) end}) enabled:Set(false) speed:Set(75) print(speed:Get()) speed:SetRange(0, 200) ", "url": "recipes.html#toggle-slider-callback"}, {"title": "Настройки через три точки", "text": " local options = enabled:Settings({Title = 'Feature settings', Width = 336}) local choices = options:Section() local mode = choices:Dropdown({Inline = true, Title = 'Mode', Flag = 'mode', Values = {'Default', 'Alternative', {Title = 'Unavailable', Locked = true}}, Value = 'Default'}) local settings = options:Section() settings:Toggle({Title = 'Smooth', Flag = 'smooth', Value = true, Hotkeys = false}) settings:Slider({Title = 'Speed', Flag = 'speed_extra', Value = {Min = 0, Max = 100, Default = 50}}) options:Open() options:Close() Inline=true допустим только в группах этого popover. На обычной странице используйте обычный Dropdown . Ширина по умолчанию 336, строки настроек компактнее обычных. ", "url": "recipes.html#_3"}, {"title": "Обычный dropdown и multi-select", "text": " local theme = right:Dropdown({Title = 'Theme', Flag = 'theme', Values = {'Dark', 'Light'}, Value = 'Dark', Callback = function(value) WindUI:SetTheme(value) end}) local selection = right:Dropdown({Title = 'Options', Multi = true, AllowNone = true, SearchBarEnabled = true, Values = {'One', 'Two', 'Three'}, Value = {'One'}}) theme:Select('Light') selection:Select({'Three', 'One'}) Превью multi-select следует порядку Values , а не порядку кликов. Для длинного значения край плавно затухает. ", "url": "recipes.html#dropdown-multi-select"}, {"title": "Описания и хоткеи", "text": " local feature = left:Toggle({Title = 'Feature', Flag = 'feature', Value = false, Desc = 'Long readable description of what this option does.', Hotkeys = {{Key = 'K', Mode = 'Toggle', Value = true}}}) feature:AddHotkey({Key = 'L', Mode = 'Hold', Value = true}) local saved = feature:GetHotkeys() feature:SetHotkeys(saved) Window:ShowHotkeys() Правый клик по toggle открывает управление биндами. Toggle/Hold/Always — режимы хоткеев; Hotkeys=false отключает их для конкретного toggle. Для пользовательского действия можно передать HotkeyCallback . Глобальная клавиша меню задаётся Window:SetToggleKey(Enum.KeyCode.F8) , а не хоткеем элемента. При DescriptionMode='Tooltip' длинное описание раскрывается при наведении на … . Панель не сжимается под курсором; − сворачивает её. Указатель можно перевести в панель, чтобы прочитать или прокрутить текст. ", "url": "recipes.html#_4"}, {"title": "Зависимые группы", "text": " local advanced = left:Toggle({Title = 'Advanced', Flag = 'advanced', Value = false}) local details = columns.Right:Section({Title = 'Details', VisibleWhen = function() return advanced.Value end}) details:Slider({Title = 'Amount', Flag = 'amount', Value = {Min = 0, Max = 10, Default = 5}}) Скрытие не удаляет значения и не исключает flagged элементы из конфигов. ", "url": "recipes.html#_5"}, {"title": "Цвет", "text": " local color = right:Colorpicker({Title = 'Color', Flag = 'color', Default = Color3.fromRGB(76, 141, 255), Transparency = .2}) color:Set(Color3.fromRGB(255, 100, 100), .1) color:Reset() local state = color:Export() color:Import(state) Для градиентов и формата stops смотрите API guide. Прозрачность хранится отдельно от RGB. ", "url": "recipes.html#_6"}, {"title": "Профиль и HUD", "text": " local profile = Window:CreateProfile({Name = 'Player'}) local hud = Window:CreateHUD({Watermark = true, Keylist = true}) hud:SetFields({'FPS', 'Ping', 'Username', 'Time'}) hud:SetWatermarkEnabled(true) hud:SetKeylistEnabled(true) hud:ResetPositions() ", "url": "recipes.html#hud"}, {"title": "Конфиги и сортировка", "text": " local presets, err = Window:EnablePresets({Default = 'Default', Author = 'Me'}) assert(presets, err) presets:Create('My setup') presets:Save('My setup') presets:Load('My setup') presets:QuickSave() presets:SetSort('Name', false) -- A–Z presets:SetSort('Name', true) -- Z–A presets:SetSort('Created', false) -- новые сначала presets:SetSort('Modified', true) -- давно изменённые сначала Create / Import отказываются перезаписывать существующий файл. Проверяйте ok, err . Сохранение и загрузка — разные действия; сортировка никогда не сохраняет конфиг. ", "url": "recipes.html#_7"}, {"title": "Завершение", "text": " Window:OnDestroy(function() print('Disconnect your own connections here') end) Window:Destroy() Библиотека управляет собственными соединениями. Ваши RunService/игровые callbacks должны иметь собственную очистку. Anti-AFK в большом демо — код примера, не скрытое поведение подключения библиотеки. Alphabetical ставит названия с буквами перед чисто числовыми: Default → Last → 231 . Повторный выбор меняет направление внутри групп: Last → Default → 231 . Числовые имена сортируются по числу. Сортировка по датам по-прежнему использует реальные created/modified timestamps. ", "url": "recipes.html#_8"}, {"title": "Compound appearance rows and mock player preview", "text": " See complete theme and composition guide for section:Compound , section:PlayerPreview , native dropdowns with left labels, and the original WindUI Dark palette. ", "url": "recipes.html#compound-appearance-rows-and-mock-player-preview"}, {"title": "Reference theme and composable appearance controls", "text": " ", "url": "composition.html#reference-theme-and-composable-appearance-controls"}, {"title": "Original WindUI Dark", "text": " local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({ Title='My menu', Folder='MyProject', Theme='Dark', NewElements=true, DescriptionMode='Tooltip', }) The Dark color definitions match upstream WindUI : Accent #18181B , Dialog #1A1A1A , Background #101010 , ElementBackground #2A2A2C , Text #FFFFFF , Toggle #33C759 , Slider #0091FF . NewElements switches use a 40×24px track and circular 20px thumb. The thumb moves with a 0.18s tween and track/thumb colors transition smoothly. Rapid clicks cancel the previous movement tween. Native Toggle flags, callbacks, locks and hotkeys are retained; non-NewElements controls remain compatible. Save/name are divided by a vertical separator. Compact dropdown fields have a permanent Dialog-colored rounded background and no hover opacity changes. The parent row has no hover fill either. ", "url": "composition.html#original-windui-dark"}, {"title": "Label on the left, dropdown on the right", "text": " Already supported in columns/cards: section:Dropdown({ Title='Target', Flag='target', Width=170, Values={'Hit Chance','Distance','Health'}, Value='Hit Chance', Callback=function(value) print(value) end, }) section:Dropdown({ Title='Hitboxes', Flag='hitboxes', Width=170, Multi=true, Values={'Head','Chest','Stomach'}, Value={'Head','Chest'}, }) ", "url": "composition.html#label-on-the-left-dropdown-on-the-right"}, {"title": "Label → color → dropdown (or toggle)", "text": " local row = section:Compound({ Title='Player', Color={Flag='player_color',Default=Color3.fromRGB(164,167,56),AllowGradient=false, Callback=function(color,transparency) MyRenderer:SetColor(color,transparency) end}, Dropdown={Flag='player_mode',Width=140,Values={'Solid','Neon','Ghost'},Value='Solid', Callback=function(mode) MyRenderer:SetMode(mode) end}, }) local box = section:Compound({ Title='Box', Color={Flag='box_color',Default=Color3.fromRGB(89,87,227)}, Toggle={Flag='box_enabled',Value=true,Callback=function(on) MyRenderer:SetBoxEnabled(on) end}, }) MyRenderer is your own object, not a library global. Each child is a real native control: row.Color:Open() , row.Color:Set(color) , row.Dropdown:Select('Ghost') , box.Toggle:Set(false) . row:GetControl('Color') returns the same child. Use an independent unique Flag on each child; do not assign a flag to the whole Compound. Dropdown and Toggle are alternatives in one row. row:Lock() , row:Unlock() , row:SetTitle(...) , row:SetVisible(...) , and row:Destroy() operate on the row. Child programmatic setters follow the corresponding native control's callback rules. ", "url": "composition.html#label-color-dropdown-or-toggle"}, {"title": "Local player mock", "text": " local preview = rightSection:PlayerPreview({Height=350,State={ Name='Preview player', Health=75, Distance='25m', Color=Color3.fromRGB(164,167,56), Mode='Solid', Box=true, }}) preview:SetColor(Color3.fromRGB(89,87,227)) preview:SetMode('Ghost') -- Solid / Neon / Ghost preview:SetBoxColor(Color3.fromRGB(89,87,227)) -- independent of model color preview:Update({Health=40,Box=false,Name='Sample'}) preview:SetEnabled(true) preview:SetRotation(30) -- Optional: clones your model; never reparents/destroys the caller's source model. preview:SetModel(myModel) preview:SetModel(nil) -- return to the built-in block dummy local state = preview:GetState() -- detached state table Connect compound callbacks to preview:SetColor , preview:SetMode or your own rendering adapter. The preview is just a local ViewportFrame/WorldModel with a mock box/name/health overlay. It does not discover players, draw through walls, hook a game, or read gameplay state. It has no polling/render loop. Scripts are removed from cloned models. The supplied model must be Archivable and contain a BasePart. Demo: Visuals → Preview. Solid/Neon/Ghost, colors, box visibility, health and rotation are interactive. The preview state itself is not persisted; store source controls with stable flags and reconstruct display state in callbacks. ", "url": "composition.html#local-player-mock"}];